fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth264parser.html#gst_h264_parse_pps","fragment":"\n\tgst_h264_parse_pps\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.prototype.h264_parse_pps\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.h264_parse_pps\n\nParses data, and fills the pps structure.\nThe resulting pps data structure shall be deallocated with the\ngst_h264_pps_clear function when it is no longer needed, or prior\nto parsing a new PPS NAL unit.\nParameters:\na GstH264NalParser\nThe GST_H264_NAL_PPS GstH264NalUnit to parse\nThe GstH264PPS to fill.\na GstH264ParserResult\nParses data, and fills the pps structure.\nThe resulting pps data structure shall be deallocated with the\nGstCodecParsers.H264PPS.prototype.clear function when it is no longer needed, or prior\nto parsing a new PPS NAL unit.\nParameters:\na GstCodecParsers.H264NalParser\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnitType.PPS GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnit to parse\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264PPS to fill.\na GstCodecParsers.H264ParserResult\nParses data, and fills the pps structure.\nThe resulting pps data structure shall be deallocated with the\nGstCodecParsers.H264PPS.clear function when it is no longer needed, or prior\nto parsing a new PPS NAL unit.\nParameters:\na GstCodecParsers.H264NalParser\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnitType.PPS GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnit to parse\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264PPS to fill.\na GstCodecParsers.H264ParserResult\n"});